{"unit_id":"Yuuyuko-uu__dsh-fish-memory#card-zh","repo":"Yuuyuko-uu/dsh-fish-memory","commit":"a070ebf096f3472c107982b5741994cabdcc18f7","type":"card","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:3034-3153","lib/index.js:3618-3859","lib/index.js:4277-4409","lib/client.js:184-220","lib/hostdeps.mjs:120-156"],"text":"鱼的记忆是面向 DSH Web 会话的长期记忆插件。它通过 remember 工具保存值得长期记住的单条信息，并按会话或工作区组织本地记忆；每条事件会随时间降低召回权重，长期事实可单独常驻。插件在每轮对话中根据当前消息、关键词证据、时间鲜活度和重要度挑选记忆，附带时间注入上下文。设置页可浏览、搜索、编辑、删除和恢复记忆，查看近期召回记录，调整遗忘与注入参数，也能扫描旧档案后选择导入，并使用 DSH 当前模型进行可选的档案提炼或检索词扩展。适合希望跨会话保留上下文、又能查看和管理记忆的 DSH 用户；不需单独配置 API key。"}
{"unit_id":"Yuuyuko-uu__dsh-fish-memory#card-en","repo":"Yuuyuko-uu/dsh-fish-memory","commit":"a070ebf096f3472c107982b5741994cabdcc18f7","type":"card","lang":"en","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:3034-3153","lib/index.js:3618-3859","lib/index.js:4277-4409","lib/client.js:184-220","lib/hostdeps.mjs:120-156"],"text":"Fish Memory adds long-term memory to DSH Web. It stores facts per session or workspace and recalls dated entries by relevance and age; stable facts persist. The panel supports search, editing, recovery, tuning, and archive import. Optional refinement and keyword expansion use DSH's model."}
